  "description_ko": "Mile High Life 웨지 마일 하이 라이프 골프 웨지입문용 샌드 세트입문용 갭 세\n옵션 이미지\n50 Degrees | 52 Degrees\n52/58 Degrees Set | 56 Degrees\n60 Degrees | 62 Degrees\n64 Degrees | Black Titanium Layer-50 Degrees\nBlack Titanium Layer-50/56 Degrees | Black Titanium Layer-52 Degrees\nBlack Titanium Layer-52/58 Degrees | Black Titanium Layer-54 Degrees\nBlack Titanium Layer-54/58/62 Degrees | Black Titanium Layer-56 Degrees\nBlack Titanium Layer-56/60/64 Degrees | Black Titanium Layer-58 Degrees\nBlack Titanium Layer-62 Degrees | Black Titanium Layer-64 Degrees\nGOODS SPECIFICS\n- Color : 50 Degrees\n- Golf Club Flex : Regular\n- Hand Orientation : Right\n- Golf Club Loft : 50 Degrees\n- Material : iron\n- Brand : Mile High Life\n- Shaft Material : steel\n- Item Weight : 0.45 Kilograms\n- Golf Putter Lie Angle : 70 Degrees\n- Grip Material : Synthetic Rubber\n- Grip Size : Normal\n- Grip Type : Wrap\n- Style : 50 Degrees\n- Golf Club Bounce Angle : 10 Degrees\n- Golf Club Type : Wedge Golf Club\n- Manufacturer : Universal Promotions\n- Item Package Dimensions L x W x H : 36.5 x 4 x 0.5 inches\n- Package Weight : 0.45 Kilograms\n- Brand Name : Mile High Life\nFeature\n- Simple Short Game Approach: Whether you are a beginner or a seasoned golfer, it is easier to focus and practice on the same shot around the green, while letting various wedges in your bag do the work for you.\n- Affordable Wedge Set: It could be very costly to keep a full set of name brand wedges; our wedge set offers variety of selections with very affordable prices.\n- Classic Quality Design: High polish finish and classic blade shape with forged premium iron set materials.\n- Full Spectrum Lofts: Selection from 50, 52, 54, 56, 58, 60 loft with 10-degree bounce.\n- Value Bundle Sets Available: (50/54/58), (52/56/60), (50/56), (52/58), (54/60)",
